+# RTSEngine objectives
+
+Resolve paths relative to the engine root. Read `libraries/catalog.json`,
+`docs/libraries.md` and `docs/native-modules.md` before integration.
+
+## Select and integrate
+
+- Layer: **simulation**. Current coverage: Event counters and one-shot completion.
+- Read `libraries/include/rtslib/Objectives.h` as the current API authority. No Lua implementation is required.
+- Use unique goal IDs and positive integer targets. Save progress. Emit completion only on threshold crossing. Branching dialogue remains planned.
+- Call `rts_native_module(...)` in the external game native/CMakeLists.txt, then `target_link_libraries(rts_native_<id> PRIVATE RTSEngine::libraries)`. Include `<rtslib/Objectives.h>`. The engine defines the target before loading game modules; do not add a second libraries subdirectory.
